[RUNNING]● Message: **Summary**
- Added the platform dashboard with KPI cards, alert feed, support queue snapshot, and ticket-driven impersonation dialog, backed by the reusable SupportQueuePanel component (`modules/core-platform/src/main/webui/src/modules/platform/views/PlatformDashboard.vue:1`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/webui/src/modules/platform/components/SupportQueuePanel.vue:1`).
- Platform store/API now manage support queue state, expose `canPerformDestructiveActions`, and fetch queue snapshots for admins (`modules/core-platform/src/main/webui/src/modules/platform/store.ts:31`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/webui/src/modules/platform/api.ts:245`).
- Feature flag management view integrates the new FeatureFlagPanel for editing governance metadata, with selection syncing and toggle/review handlers (`modules/core-platform/src/main/webui/src/modules/platform/components/FeatureFlagPanel.vue:1`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/webui/src/modules/platform/views/FeatureFlagManagementView.vue:1`).
- Store directory enforces reason and ticket capture before impersonation, disables destructive actions when governance fields are missing, and the banner now shows elapsed time plus safety warnings (`modules/core-platform/src/main/webui/src/modules/platform/views/StoreDirectoryView.vue:2`, `modules/core-platform/src/main/webui/src/modules/platform/components/ImpersonationBanner.vue:1`).
- Playwright page objects and specs were expanded to cover the dashboard, stricter impersonation workflow, and audit verification assertions (`tests/e2e/playwright/pages/PlatformConsolePage.ts:19`, `tests/e2e/playwright/platform-console.spec.ts:1`).

